        role: "Park attendant",
        exam: [.direct("What happened at the dog park at about 5 p.m. on {DATE}?", "\"A bite occurred between two dogs. Two minutes later, {D} punched {V}, another dog owner, and split {V}'s lip.\""), .direct("What does the park camera show?", "\"It shows {DL} punching {V}. It shows the two of them near the fence and the punch landing.\""), .direct("What were {V}'s injuries?", "\"A cut lip, according to the medical note. {V} had bleeding and needed attention.\""), .direct("How does the dog park work at 5 p.m.?", "\"It is our busiest hour, with a dozen owners and a mix of large and small dogs. The big dog side has a double gate, and leashes are required until owners are inside.\""), .direct("What happened with the dogs?", "\"Two dogs got into a scuffle by the water bowl. One bit the other on the hind leg, and the owners pulled them apart within a few seconds.\""), .direct("What did you see after the dogs were separated?", "\"{DL} walked up to {V} and said something loud. About two minutes later {DL} swung a fist and hit {V} in the mouth, and {V} went down on one knee.\""), .cross("{DL} says {V}'s dog bit {D.his} dog, doesn't {D.he}?", "\"I saw that there was a bite. I can't say exactly which dog started it.\""), .cross("Did anyone try to break it up?", "\"I tried to step in once I saw it. It happened very fast. The punch came two minutes after the bite.\""), .cross("Did {V} do or say anything to {DL}?", "\"There was some talk between them. I couldn't hear all of it. I didn't see {V} hit first.\""), .cross("{V}'s dog was off leash, wasn't it?", "\"I think so, because the gate was open and many dogs were loose inside. I could not see a leash on it at the moment of the bite.\""), .cross("{V} said sorry first, didn't {V.he}?", "\"I believe {V.he} said sorry once. I did not hear what followed, only {DL}'s raised voice.\"")],
